  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "License-aware auto-update and rollback: SdkUpdateManager now sends licenseKey/hardwareId/productId to server for version access checks. Perpetual licenses: updates offered with user acceptance required. NodeLocked/Trial/Subscription: updates only offered if user has access (HasAccessToAllVersions or assigned UserProductRelease or license-linked SoftwareReleasesLicenses). Added SetLicenseContext(), RequiresUserAcceptance flag, LicenseType in UpdateInfo. Backend /api/updates/check now validates license type and filters versions by entitlement. Added GetByLicenseKeyWithReleasesAsync to LicenseRepository.",
